    "Sentiment history (values > 0.20) is ignored or underweighted; model ignores bullish sentiment signals that precede sharp price recoveries.",
    "Model assumes low volatility and smooth paths, whereas true outcomes display high frequency reversals and sudden directional shifts.",
    "When recent prices are near historical highs, the model fails to anticipate a 'sell-off' correction even if sentiment remains neutral or slightly positive."
